# Mobile App Starter Rules

1. Read `.ai/AGENTS.md` for core architectural principles (MVVM/Clean Architecture).
2. Always ensure separation of concerns: UI, State, Domain, Data.
3. Use environment variables for all API endpoints.
4. Assume a local mock API is available at `http://localhost:3000`.
5. Implement loading states and error boundaries for all asynchronous actions.
